      'By linking your article to formal Wikipedia and Wikidata concepts using `about` and `sameAs` attributes, you allow Google\'s Knowledge Graph and Perplexity\'s retrieval agent to map your publication directly to established ontology nodes.',

      '## 6. Measuring Brand Citations and AI Impression Share',
      'One of the greatest challenges in GEO is attribution: traditional analytics tools like Google Analytics 4 (GA4) often classify generative AI referrals under generic "direct" traffic or obscure referrer domains.',
      '### Framework for Tracking Generative Visibility:',
