      '## 7. Real-World Agency Case Study: Dominating Perplexity & Google AI Overviews (+380% Referral Surge)',
      'To demonstrate how **Generative Engine Optimization GEO** drives tangible commercial revenue, review our enterprise engagement with [Apex Cloud Systems](/services#cloud-architecture), a developer tooling infrastructure provider.',
      '### The Challenge',
